    "body_html": "<p>Immortelle or “everlasting flower” has been highly valued since the time of the ancient Greeks for its amazing wound healing abilities. </p>\n<p>Its essential oil is also rich in molecules which support skin cell turnover and has strong anti-aging properties — which is why it is used today in many high-end cosmetic products. </p>\n<p>What most people don’t know is that this precious essential oil is also effective in soothing dry, irritated skin and improving our skin’s natural elasticity! </p>\n<p>This is why Immortelle Essential Oil is one of the key ingredient in our Overnight Nourishing Balm. </p>\n<p>Simply apply a thin layer of Overnight Nourishing Balm onto your baby bump before bed, and wake up to soft, supple skin.</p>",
